WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:04.671
A conspiracy theory is a theory

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:05.964
that there is someone

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:07.924
bigger that is pulling the strings.

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.803
There are wealthy,

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.513
powerful families

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.390
 that control

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:16.933
everything.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.354
The Nazis aren't coming,

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.063
they're here.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.984
Our elections were stolen.

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:29.946
You Devil worshiping Satanist witch!

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:32.824
The rule of law in this country

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:33.992
has been eliminated!

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.497
There's money to be made here.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:41.374
People are dying that don't need to!

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.001
They're trying to manufacture anger.

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:45.378
I lost everything I ever worked for.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.963
I miss my dad all the time.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.257
This is really pulling people in.

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.551
I'm never gonna talk to him again.

